The Mod is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The author is not liable for any
claim, damage or loss arising from its use, including lost or damaged worlds. Back up your
worlds.


5. ENDING THIS LICENSE

If you break this license, your rights under it end automatically. This does not affect other
